      "verification": "NaCCA National Pre-tertiary Education Curriculum Framework (2019), Table 3 (lower primary) and Table 4 (upper primary and JHS): A 80+, B 65-79, C 45-64, D 30-44, E 0-29. The same section 8.5.4.1 of the framework prints a different school scale (A 80-100, B 70-79, C 60-69, D 45-59, E 35-44, U up to 34); this pack uses Tables 3 and 4 and the bands are school-overridable. Bands are whole marks, so each scheme rounds the learning-area total half-up to a whole mark before lookup."
    },
    {
      "code": "gh_bece_9",
